  "eng-2006-p3|One argument in support of women's liberation is that it|compels men to take over the tasks of cooking, cleaning and other household chores|encourages Nigerian women to eke out a living independently|enables more women to attain higher positions|brings improvement at home, at work and in politics": "comprehension",
  "eng-2006-p3|Which of the following captures the vision of the writer on the future of Nigerian women?|It is possible for Nigerian women to attain equal status with men.|Nigerians will never accept a woman president for the country.|Nigerian higher institutions can produce more women doctors, lawyers and accountants than men.|If the present trend is not checked, Nigerian women will take over the roles of men.": "comprehension",
